The '''Argofay Bughunter''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Wyld Woods}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Interface ==
Once the player gives the '''Argofay Bughunter''' the requested {{Item|Larva Silk|amount=6}}, the player will be rewarded with a [[Silkwire Stick]], opening the following menu.
{{/UI}}
Upon completing the '''Argofay Bughunter'''<nowiki/>'s quest and giving them {{Item|Bottled Odonata|amount=8}}, the player will be rewarded with the [[Silkrider Safety Belt]], opening the following menu.
{{/UI 2}}

