== Trivia ==
* "Argofay" is likely [[w:Pig Latin|Pig Latin]] for "Fargo".
* The line "Because few words do trick" is a reference to the character [[fandom:theoffice:Kevin Malone|Kevin Malone]] from [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VvPaEsuz-tY this scene] in [[fandom:theoffice:The Incentive|an episode]] of the NBC show [[fandom:theoffice:The Office|''The Office'']].

